{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 40 — Model tuning & pipelines (GridSearchCV/RandomizedSearchCV)\n","Objectives:\n","- Build a Pipeline.\n","- Perform parameter search.\n","- Discuss nested CV for unbiased estimates.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV\n","from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n","from sklearn.svm import SVC\n","from sklearn.datasets import load_breast_cancer\n","X,y = load_breast_cancer(return_X_y=True)\n","pipe = Pipeline([('sc', StandardScaler()), ('svc', SVC())])\n","param_grid = {'svc__C':[0.1,1,10], 'svc__kernel':['linear','rbf']}\n","gs = GridSearchCV(pipe, param_grid, cv=5, scoring='roc_auc')\n","gs.fit(X,y)\n","gs.best_params_, gs.best_score_\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercises\n","1) Try RandomizedSearchCV with a wider parameter space.\n","2) Implement nested CV and compare results."]}]}
